OL,3,ABriton among 119 rescued in Nepal after
OL,4,Adeadly floods, army says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Briton is among 119 people to have
OL,7,Fbeen rescued in Nepal following deadly
OL,8,Ffloods, a spokesperson for the
OL,9,Fcountry's army said.
OL,11,FIt comes nearly a week after the
OL,12,Fdevastating floods hit the country and
OL,13,Fneighbouring Tibet, killing more than
OL,14,F1,000 people, with more than 3,900
OL,15,Fstill missing.
OL,17,FThe British national, who has not yet
OL,18,Fbeen identified, was rescued using air
OL,19,Fresources, the Nepali army said in a
OL,20,FFacebook post.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
