OL,3,ABriton among 119 rescued in Nepal after
OL,4,Adeadly floods, army says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere were also 118 Nepalese people
OL,7,Frescued, of whom 44 were female and 74
OL,8,Fmale, the spokesperson said from Bidur
OL,9,Farmy camp in the Trishuli Nuwakot
OL,10,Fdistrict.
